CredentialRegistryAccountListValidatorPolicy_run
├── when every account has KYC
│   └── it should return Continue
├── when any account does not have KYC
│   └── it should revert
├── when parameters are empty
│   └── it should revert
├── when parameters have multiple items
│   └── it should revert
└── when account list is empty
    └── it should revert
